            "season_label": "Summer & Eid",
            "fabric_name": "Georgette Anarkali",
            "feel_desc": "The flared silhouette creates natural airflow around your legs — you stay cool while the fabric floats. Georgette is so light you forget you're wearing it, even in 40°C outdoor ceremonies.",
            "callout_1": "Flare creates airflow",
            "callout_2": "Feather-light on skin",
            "callout_3": "No sweat marks"
